2. The apps, the skill, the look and the bundle format: Apache License,
   version 2.0 (SPDX: Apache-2.0, LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt).

     app/        the headset app for Quest and Android XR, and its tools
     visionos/   the headset app for Apple Vision Pro
     mac/        the Mac app
     ios/        the iPhone app
     skill/      what a coding agent reads to load a recording
     design/     the colours, type and drawing scripts every platform shares

   The bundle format (the folder a recording becomes: session.json,
   transcript.json, frames.json and the files beside them) may be read and
   written by anything, under any licence.

   The apps reach polycap over HTTP or by running it as a separate program,
   so the two licences do not combine into one work.

